        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
            "fadetime": 0.7
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#3$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas",
        "text": "Absolutely not!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#3$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catch Lightrace",
        "text": "Let's try a different idea, then. We'll use the water cannons to hurl people up to the springboards high above..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#3$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas",
        "text": "Don't you have any ideas that don't involve water cannons?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#3$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catch Lightrace",
        "text": "But it's a brilliant epiphany, and you were the one who inspired me! Well, in that case, do you have any bright ideas, Stitch the amazing architectural designer?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#5$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas",
        "text": "Ugh... I was just going to be the lead architectural designer and dial down Acahuallans' plans a little."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#5$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catch Lightrace",
        "text": "You had the surface-dwellers come to help with the bridge. I have no problem with that. But now we're discussing the thing that will go on top of the bridge and live alongside it, the landmark of Zeruertza!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#5$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catch Lightrace",
        "text": "You don't want to work on the dome with me. Fine, I get how you feel about the dome. Then let's talk about what will be our next landmark after the big water slide."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas",
        "text": "There's a much simpler and more graceful way to solve this. It could be brimming with symbolism!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#5$1",
            "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catch Lightrace",
        "text": "It could be more exciting!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#5$1",
            "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#6$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas",
        "text": "It could be more exciting and brimming with symbolism!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#5$1",
            "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#6$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas",
        "text": "Phew, Catch, arguing about this here isn't going to get us anywhere. How about we have a design competition? We'll give each other some time to work on a design and let the citizens of Zeruertza decide."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#6$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catch Lightrace",
        "text": "Of course. Just like all those years ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface",
        "text": "I'm on board too\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catch Lightrace",
        "text": "Croque? Are you drinking?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_566_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface",
        "text": "I'm fine. I only had a tiny little bit."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_075"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Inam",
        "text": "You emptied three whole barrels by yourself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_566_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface",
        "text": "Stitch, I heard your proposal. I'm interested."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_566_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface",
        "text": "And if Catch is up for it, then that's all the better!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_566_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface",
        "text": "Now we just need to find Deculture, and we'll build something new for Zeruertza!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
