    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catch Lightrace",
        "text": "Speaking of which, what was our last meeting with everyone in attendance for?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface",
        "text": "Alcohol was in short supply, so we had a meeting to figure out how to solve the supply chain issues."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_569_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint",
        "text": "Have we ever run low on alcohol?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_566_1#10$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface",
        "text": "You skipped that meeting."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_564_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart",
        "text": "Hahaha, this brings me back. The mead fans wanted to make sure the whiskey lovers had nothing to drink, so they bought out all the whiskey in town."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart",
        "text": "And to get back at the mead fans, the Whiskey Enthusiasts' Association started buying up mead by the lot too."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "These drunkards can survive without booze?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_566_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface",
        "text": "Of course not. That's why they started drinking the booze they bought to get at the other side."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catch Lightrace",
        "text": "I understand both clubs lost some members to the other side around that time, haha!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catch Lightrace",
        "text": "It's a shame, though. If only they had an appreciation for berry tomato wine."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_566_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_569_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_564_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart",
        "text": "Catch, you... so that's your poison?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catch Lightrace",
        "text": "Yeah, what's the matter?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_566_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface",
        "text": "No wonder none of the alcohol fan clubs accepted you..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart",
        "text": "Well... Never mind, so we're all gathered today to discuss the 'Great Aquapit...'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_569_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint",
        "text": "Tear it down? Yeah, I agree, and the sooner the better."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface",
        "text": "I'm a yea, too."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catch Lightrace",
        "text": "I thought you two loved that place! Hell, you go multiple times a week, Croque!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_566_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface",
        "text": "Right, and I'm regretting my patronage. I can't believe I spent so much time in a facility built by a guy who likes berry tomato wine... It's a disgrace."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_569_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint",
        "text": "How negligent I must have been as the industrial representative to participate in a project led by a man like that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catch Lightrace",
        "text": "What is that supposed to mean?! Hey, Master Edge, what's with that look?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_564_1#10$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart",
        "text": "Haha, berry tomato wine... That's a little..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "If you've reached an understanding, then we'll call everyone out to blow up that showy water slide, fix the railroads, and solve all of Master Edge's problems. That's the plan. Any objections?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catch Lightrace",
        "text": "It's a shame, but an architect can't let his past work tie him down. This is a chance to once again put my talents to good use."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface",
        "text": "Stitch, you said you'd have a design contest with Catch over Zeruertza's new landmark. You are serious about that, aren't you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas",
        "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_564_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart",
        "text": "Oh? Finally going to amaze us with your designs again?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas",
        "text": "Well, with all of you here singing my praises, what choice do I have?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_564_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart",
        "text": "Looks like we're in for a fun couple of months. I should stock up on booze."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catch Lightrace",
        "text": "Seriously, Master Edge, why don't you try some berry tomato wine? It really isn't as bad as it sounds."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_564_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart",
        "text": "Not in a million years."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
